      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْقِيَا الأَنْفِ</span></b>  [in my MS. copy of the K <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرْقِيَا</span>]
<i>The two edges</i> [or <i>alœ</i>] <i>of the nose:</i> (K, TA:)
so says Th; but the expression commonly known
is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَقَّا الأَنْفِ</span>, mentioned before [in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رق</span>]. (TA.)

